\f1\b  Army Card Prototype \'96 Systems & Gameplay Overview (Revised)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf0 Core Concept\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs24 \cf0 A 
\f1\b turn-based auto-battler with deck-building elements
\f2\b0 .\
Players build an army over multiple rounds by 
\f1\b drawing cards, buying units with gold, arranging formations
\f2\b0 , and then watching 
\f1\b deterministic combat resolve automatically
\f2\b0 .\
There is 
\f1\b no manual control during combat
\f2\b0  \'97 all strategy happens 
\f1\b before
\f2\b0  combat begins.\
The system is built to be 
\f1\b fully inspectable, deterministic, and event-driven
\f2\b0 , with a clean separation between simulation and playback.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \
